{{Status Templates}}
Displays a '''GRADUATED''' status badge and, in the main namespace, files the page under the matching activity category. Used on utaite and unit pages where the person or group has formally retired from activity. Part of the status template family — see {{T|Active}}, {{T|Inactive}} and {{T|Hiatus}}.

==Syntax==
{{T|Graduated|block=1
|v1=nocat =
|v2=groups =
}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Graduated|_Y_=1|p1=nocat = true}}
* <code><nowiki>This utaite is {{Graduated}}.</nowiki></code> — badge '''and''' categorizes under [[:Category:Graduated Utaite]]
* <code><nowiki>{{Graduated|groups=true}}</nowiki></code> — badge and categorizes under [[:Category:Graduated Units]]

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
